{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261123/photo/bkn-20261123020003539-1123_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261123080451\"/><p>大埔有人酒後駕駛。昨日(22日)晚上10時47分，執法部門接獲途人報案，指在汀角路與大福街交界位置，目睹一名司機在車廂中飲酒後駕駛其私家車，懷疑他酒後駕駛，於是報案。</p><p>人員接報到場截獲涉事私家車，發現姓梁(42歲)男司機身上有酒氣，酒精呼氣測試證實超標，涉嫌「酒後駕駛」被捕。經調查後梁男獲准保釋候查，須於12月下旬向執法部門報到。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T00:23:53.052257+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T18:00:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T13:28:17.956083+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T00:17:48.148612+00:00","content_hash":"ed104a23541c5a21ac4cde726414c617a1375c4143fa6d28a92450f8adb12f4b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T00:23:53.052257+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}